  "body": "This substantial, California Spanish Mission style residence is nothing short of superb. Positioned for privacy, sunshine, and relaxation, it showcases outstanding architectural design and masterful craftsmanship throughout. Every detail has been carefully considered, with bespoke fittings and flawless finishes that create an atmosphere of refined elegance both inside and out.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is a striking curved plan arranging the open-plan kitchen, dining, and living space around the outdoor entertaining area and stunning swimming pool - the ultimate setting for relaxed summer living and effortless family gatherings. This curved living continues on to the office and two bedrooms both with access to outdoor living, plus a guest powder room designed to impress, family bathroom and ensuite.\r\n\r\nIn 2016 the current owners engaged Caaht Architects to carry out a complete remodel and renovation. This involved new joinery, new internal walls and raked ceilings throughout. The new cedar clad addition has it's own entrance, two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchenette and spacious lounge with access to a private garden area. Ideal as a work-from-home space, a guest retreat, or a private haven for teenagers.\r\n\r\nMultiple formal and informal living zones ensure space for every occasion. This home provides exceptional comfort and versatility. \r\n\r\nJust a short stroll from Milford beach and moments from top local schools, boutique shops, cafés, and the vibrant Takapuna lifestyle, this exceptional property represents a rare opportunity to secure your own private resort lifestyle in one of the North Shore's most desirable locations.",
